      "message": "\u003e Is DXC shared and should it be pulled in as well?\n\nI\u0027m not seeing any mention of \"dxc\" in [Chromium\u0027s DEPS file](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:DEPS)\n\n\u003e zlib\n\nThis is actually synced, but since Dawn uses the version exported by Chromium, it\u0027s in `EXPORTED_CHROMIUM_REPOS` mapping instead.\n\n\u003e opengl-registry, egl-registry\n\nSimilar to DXC, I\u0027m not seeing any mention of either of those in Chromium\u0027s DEPS file.\n\n\u003e Have we gone through all the dawn deps and set them to sync\u0027d or is this a specific list?\n\nThis is based on the list in the \"Automatic DEPS Rolling\" section of go/dawn-standalone-builders-dd that I initially got by auditing all of Dawn\u0027s DEPS entries and seeing if there was an equivalent in Chromium\u0027s file. It\u0027s possible that new entries that should be synced were added since the doc was written, but this should be a fairly complete list.",
